New algorithm: Assign priority based on the ratio of the item size to the bin's current capacity, preferring bins where the item represents a larger proportion of the remaining space, while rejecting overfull bins.
}

{
Prioritize bins where the item fits by maximizing the reciprocal of the remaining capacity, and break ties by preferring bins with smaller current capacity.
}

{
